# Default deny: publish only application source and explicitly named static assets.
**
!pyproject.toml
!README.md
!LICENSE
!token_tv/
!token_tv/**/
!token_tv/**/*.py
!token_tv/web/*.html
!token_tv/web/*.js
!token_tv/web/*.css
!token_tv/web/*.ttf
!token_tv/web/*.woff2
